{"seq":1,"slug":"questions-of-authorship","title":"Questions Of Authorship","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/questions-of-authorship","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-authorship-question","title":"文本与作者","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/questions-of-authorship/the-authorship-question","wordCount":2078,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"interpreting-zhuangzi","title":"诠释的多样","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/controversies-and-appraisal/questions-of-authorship/interpreting-zhuangzi","wordCount":1864,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章审视《庄子》的文本与作者问题，以及对庄子的诠释。《庄子》并非庄子一人一时之作，而是庄子及其后学的著作集——内、外、杂篇在作者、年代、思想上存在差异（内篇最能代表庄子本人），现存文本经郭象整理而定型。此外，《庄子》思想深邃、意蕴丰富，历来有着多样的诠释。本章以严谨、审慎、全面的态度，辨析这些文本与诠释问题。\n"}